Maintainer: Robert Vidigal <robert.vidigal@vanderbilt.edu>
Description: Labeling, weighting, and plotting data following custom
        style guidelines for use in reports, presentations, and social
        media posts. The Center for Global Democracy (formerly the
        Latin American Public Opinion Project) at Vanderbilt University
        is a leader in public survey research, best known for the
        Americas Barometer project. The publicly available data can be
        downloaded from:
        <https://www.vanderbilt.edu/lapop/data-access.php>.
